                        "description": "Create a new expense or income event.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (logged-in user)\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `type` (string, required): Event type - 'EXPENSE' or 'INCOME'\n- `amount` (number|string, required): Amount of the event (positive number)\n- `currency_id` (string, required): UUID of the currency\n- `quantity` (number, optional): Quantity (defaults to 1)\n- `description` (string, required): Description of the event\n- `event_date` (string, required): ISO 8601 date string\n- `parent_event_id` (string, optional): UUID for parent recurring event\n- `recurrence_rule` (string, optional): RFC 5545 RRULE format\n- `recurrence_end_date` (string, optional): ISO 8601 date string\n\n**Response:**\n- `success` (boolean): Whether the event was created\n- `data` (object): Created event with id, timestamps, and all fields\n- `error` (string): Error message if creation failed\n\n**Status Codes:**\n- 201: Event created successfully\n- 400: Invalid request data\n- 401: Unauthorized (not logged in)\n- 404: Currency not found\n- 500: Server error"
                    },
